# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LMS web app — local development. Copy to `.env` (git-ignored).
# The app always calls the API on its own origin (/api). In development Vite proxies /api to
# the backend below; in production the API serves the web app itself, on one origin.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Backend used by the Vite dev server proxy (backend `yarn dev` listens on 8790).
VITE_API_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:8790
